[al:新概念英语（二）]
[ar:MP3 同步字幕版（英音）]
[ti:Percy Buttons]
[00:13.15]Who is Percy Buttons?
[00:18.39]I have just moved to a house in Bridge Street.
[00:23.38]Yesterday a beggar knocked at my door.
[00:27.38]He asked me for a meal and a glass of beer.
[00:32.04]In return for this, the beggar stood on his head and sang songs.
[00:38.42]I gave him a meal.
[00:40.91]He ate the food and drank the beer.
[00:44.70]Then he put a piece of cheese in his pocket and went away.
[00:50.63]Later a neighbour told me about him.
[00:54.99]Everybody knows him.
[00:57.40]His name is Percy Buttons.
[01:00.32]He calls at every house in the street once a month and always asks for a meal and a glass of beer.
